221→## Debugging
222→
223→### Common Syntax Error: Missing Brackets [[Ep5, 148:44](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=8924s)]
224→```vex
225→if(rand(@primnum, ch('seed')) < ch('cutoff')){
226→    removepoint(0, @primnum, 1);
227→}
228→```
229→A common syntax error occurs when forgetting to close brackets in conditional statements, especially when using channel references with the ch() function. This example demonstrates proper bracket matching in an if statement that randomly removes primitives based on a threshold value.
