231→## Groups
232→
233→### Random Primitive Removal [[Ep5, 157:04](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=9424s)]
234→```vex
235→if(rand(@primnum, ch('seed')) < ch('cutoff')){
236→    removeprim(0, @primnum, 1);
237→}
238→```
239→Conditionally removes primitives based on a random threshold comparison. Uses rand() with primitive number and seed to generate random values, then removes the primitive if the value is below the cutoff parameter.
