241→### Random Primitive Removal [[Ep5, 157:06](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=9426s)]
242→```vex
243→if(rand(@primnum, ch('seed')) < ch('cutoff')) {
244→    removeprim(0, @primnum, 1);
