261→### Primitive Deletion Based on Random Threshold [[Ep5, 158:16](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=9496s)]
262→```vex
263→if(rand(@primnum, ch("seed")) < ch("cutoff")) {
