431→## Miscellaneous Tips
432→
433→### Point Array Variable Declaration [Needs Review] [[Ep5, 68:08](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=4088s)]
434→```vex
435→int pts[];
436→int pt;
437→```
438→Declares two integer variables: an empty array 'pts' to store multiple point numbers, and a single integer 'pt' for individual point operations. These are typically used in preparation for point cloud queries or neighbor finding operations.
