451→### Debugging Packed Transform Matrix [[Ep7, 142:38](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ztkhG7DhuA&t=8558s)]
452→```vex
453→matrix pft = primintrinsic(0, "packedfullransform", @ptnum);
454→4@a = pft;
455→```
456→Demonstrates how to debug packed primitive transforms by reading the packedfullransform intrinsic attribute into a matrix variable, then writing it to a 4x4 matrix detail attribute for inspection. This allows visualization of the full transformation matrix applied to each packed primitive.
